Refit Filters (Weapon Class) is a fork of Refit Filters by Starficz.

Upstream license notice (unchanged):
All Code under org.starficz.refitfilters is marked with CC0-1.0. To view a copy of this license, visit https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
All Code under org.starficz.UIFramework is marked with LGPL-3.0-only. To view a copy of this license, see https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

This fork:
- In this fork the packages are renamed so the fork can be installed next to the original without class clashes: org.starficz.refitfilters is now sztarek.refitfilterswc, and org.starficz.UIFramework is now sztarek.refitfilterswc.uiframework. The licenses follow the code.
- The Weapon Class filter added by this fork (under sztarek.refitfilterswc) is released under CC0-1.0, the same terms as the code it extends.
- The UI framework code (sztarek.refitfilterswc.uiframework) is redistributed under LGPL-3.0-only with one modification: the package rename noted above. Nothing else in it was changed. Full license texts are included as LICENSE-LGPL-3.0.txt and LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt, and the complete source is in the src folder and at https://github.com/Sztarek/starsector-refit-filter-mod
- The mod icon (icon.ico) and the settings icon (graphics/icons/refit_filters_luna_icon.png) are Starficz's artwork and are not covered by the code licenses above.

AI disclosure:
The Weapon Class filter in this fork was vibe coded: Sztarek described the feature, an AI coding assistant (Claude, by Anthropic) wrote the code, and Sztarek tested it in-game. Starficz's original code was not written with AI.
